    {
      "jobId": "bb6383b0-7b6d-4f62-b2e0-d2a07b217e1d",
      "question": "Which three failure codes caused the most unplanned downtime hours between 1 October 2025 and 30 September 2026, and how many hours did each cause?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T05:33:25.476398Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T05:33:30.957170Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Top three failure codes by unplanned downtime hours (1 Oct 2025 – 30 Sep 2026)**\n\n| Failure code | Total unplanned downtime (hours) |\n|--------------|----------------------------------|\n| SPN-BRG      | 1,088.7                          |\n| PMP-WEAR     | 232.6                            |\n| SRV-DRV      | 224.3                            |\n\n[1]\n\n**Note:** The data covers all three plants (DAY, MTY, BRN) and includes only unplanned maintenance events with a non-empty failure code.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — manufacturing_operations — evidence `hermes-receipt:8eb4406688381278089f9c209afd5f8f5ab83f036d599c11de06000163aa7549`",
